    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature-trait\"><em>Wisdom Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=zvnlZKMEskNJUahH]], each [[lookup @target.affects.type activity=zvnlZKMEskNJUahH]] in a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=zvnlZKMEskNJUahH]]-[[lookup @target.template.units activity=zvnlZKMEskNJUahH]] Emanation originating from the [[lookup @name lowercase]]. <em>Failure:</em> The target has the &amp;Reference[Paralyzed apply=false] condition, and it repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. After [[lookup @duration.value activity=zvnlZKMEskNJUahH]] [[lookup @duration.units activity=zvnlZKMEskNJUahH]], it succeeds automatically.</p>",
